  {
   "id": "the-beast-inside-88116@patch-2019-10-31",
   "gameId": "the-beast-inside-88116",
   "displayName": "Special Halloween Patch",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2019-10-31T21:56:48.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Beasts,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "let's celebrate this Halloween with a Special Halloween Treat!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "The new update is here!",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "What's in it for you?",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "1. Head Bobbing is now possible to turn off/on in the game options.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "2. Fixed error of falling characters after the sequence in the shed in Chapter 2.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "3. Achievement for Enigma is also granted on Medium level",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "4. Additional tips in the form of monologues are added to Enigma scene",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "5. Possibility of standing up from crouching near the anomaly.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "6. Improved readability of LPM and PPM icons",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "7. No voice overs cut when resolving an enigma",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "8. Rotating the Caesar disk is not dependent on FPS.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "9. Possibility of changing the FOV in the range of 75-100.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "10. Fixed issue where the radio in individual chapters did not turn off properly.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "11. Numerous audio bug fixes in chapter 04.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "12. Fixed issue where Adam's flashlight would turn off by itself in Chapter 11.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "13. Fixed issue where the miner's ghost in Chapter 08 would get stuck in individual places.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "14. Fixed collision errors in swamps in chapter 10 that caused a player blockage.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "15. Bug with disappearing doors in escape sequence in chapter 12 has been corrected.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "16. Fixed issue where stones in the well from Chapter 09 sank to the ground.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "17. Patch fixes in collisions in chapter 10",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "And hey, a little extra treat for you - our friends from Movie Games Lunarium has just released Lust from Beyond:Prologue, an intro to the full game - Lust from Beyond, have a go, because now it is for FREE!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "All The Be(a)st,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Illusion Ray Studio & Movie Games",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
