  {
   "id": "the-beast-inside-88116@major-2019-10-21",
   "gameId": "the-beast-inside-88116",
   "displayName": "#1 Update has landed!",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2019-10-21T17:19:45.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Dear Beasts,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "the first update for The Beast Inside has landed!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Let’s have a look at the list of what has been improved",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "1. Improved music playback and SFX balance in Chapter 10",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "2. Improving music analysis in Chapter 12",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "3. Improved collision in Adam’s world in Chapter 05/07/09",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "4. The error with the incorrect opening of the cut scene in Chapter 4 has been fixed",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "5. Balance of revolver ammunition in Chapter 4",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "6. Fixed a bug with getting stuck on Boss arena in Chapter 4",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "7. Correction in the interpretation of blur settings",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "8. The projector in Chapter 07 now contains the correct image at the low setting",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "9. In Chapter 10 the correct brightness at low settings is now improved",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "10. The jump icon in the table with the PS4 gamepad settings is corrected",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "11. QTE mouse icons are improved",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "12. Minor collisions’ fixes",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "13. Corrections in the Russian translation",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "14. Corrections in the French translation",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "15. Dying after successful lockpicking no longer causes an error",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "16. Maria in Chapter 10 no longer kills the player during lock opening sequence",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "17. The pipe in Adam's house no longer blocks the passage.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "18. A premature fall of the bridge in Chapter 5 is no longer possible",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We are working on the next patches so stay tuned and enjoy the game!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "All The Be(a)st,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Illusion Ray Studio & Movie Games",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "P.S.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
